 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "f4d7c418-2e7e-4745-90dd-3ad12d32aa92",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36c94183-19f3-801c-b4ea-dc8b4518971f"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-28T13:46:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-05-28T13:46:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "paragraph",
  "paragraph": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "Three shifts in the AI development landscape created the conditions that made Flowise necessary.",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "Three shifts in the AI development landscape created the conditions that made Flowise necessary.",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "icon": null,
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "ab503a06-320b-46f4-a41f-a794606f9ab0",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36c94183-19f3-801c-b4ea-dc8b4518971f"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-28T13:46:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-06-09T13:01:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "114d872b-594c-8174-9474-0002954cf668"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "numbered_list_item",
  "numbered_list_item": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "The first reason was the growing number of moving parts in AI systems. Teams had to connect language models that write responses, embedding models that turn text into searchable numerical meaning, vector databases that store and search that meaning, memory components that keep useful context, and external tools such as APIs or databases. As these pieces multiplied, building everything in raw code became harder to manage.\nA visual abstraction layer that handled the connections reduced that surface to a manageable configuration problem.",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "The first reason was the growing number of moving parts in AI systems. Teams had to connect language models that write responses, embedding models that turn text into searchable numerical meaning, vector databases that store and search that meaning, memory components that keep useful context, and external tools such as APIs or databases. As these pieces multiplied, building everything in raw code became harder to manage.\nA visual abstraction layer that handled the connections reduced that surface to a manageable configuration problem.",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "79c4d3fe-47d5-48eb-99dd-13056aa4f34f",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36c94183-19f3-801c-b4ea-dc8b4518971f"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-28T13:46:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-06-03T16:45:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "114d872b-594c-8174-9474-0002954cf668"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "numbered_list_item",
  "numbered_list_item": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "The second was the emergence of agentic patterns. Agents are reasoning loops that call tools, observe results, and decide what to do next. Representing those loops in code requires architectural discipline that is error-prone and hard to debug. A canvas that makes the loop visible makes it significantly easier to reason about and correct.",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "The second was the emergence of agentic patterns. Agents are reasoning loops that call tools, observe results, and decide what to do next. Representing those loops in code requires architectural discipline that is error-prone and hard to debug. A canvas that makes the loop visible makes it significantly easier to reason about and correct.",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "3366cc07-818c-4d04-bb2c-7f205a6dc926",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36c94183-19f3-801c-b4ea-dc8b4518971f"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-28T13:46:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-06-03T16:45:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "114d872b-594c-8174-9474-0002954cf668"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "numbered_list_item",
  "numbered_list_item": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "The third was the need for rapid iteration. Agent behaviour emerges from the interaction of prompt, memory, retrieval, and tools. Changing one parameter and immediately observing the effect in the built-in test interface is a faster feedback loop than editing code, redeploying, and retesting manually.",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "The third was the need for rapid iteration. Agent behaviour emerges from the interaction of prompt, memory, retrieval, and tools. Changing one parameter and immediately observing the effect in the built-in test interface is a faster feedback loop than editing code, redeploying, and retesting manually.",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
